**Severity:** High
**Issue:** The new SidebarUserNav is missing the ChevronUp icon that indicates the button is a dropdown trigger.
**Old Code:** archive/oldapp/components/sidebar-user-nav.tsx:87 - `<ChevronUp className="ml-auto" />`
**New Code:** features/sidebar/components/sidebar-user-nav.tsx:77-99 - No ChevronUp icon in SidebarMenuButton
