## MessageActions Missing SWR Cache Mutation
**File:** features/chat/components/message-actions.tsx
**Severity:** Medium
**Issue:** The new MessageActions component doesn't update the SWR cache after voting, so the UI won't update optimistically.
**Old Code:** archive/oldapp/components/message-actions.tsx:92-123 - Mutates SWR cache:
  ```tsx
  toast.promise(upvote, {
      success: () => {
          mutate<UserVote[]>(
              `/api/vote?chatId=${chatId}`,
              (currentVotes) => {
                  // Filter and add new vote
                  return [...votesWithoutCurrent, { chatId, messageId, isUpvoted: true }];
              },
              { revalidate: false }
          );
          return "Upvoted Response!";
      },
  });
  ```
**New Code:** features/chat/components/message-actions.tsx:255-269 - No cache mutation:
  ```tsx
  const handleUpvote = () => {
      const upvote = fetch("/api/vote", { ... });
      toast.promise(upvote, {
          success: () => "Upvoted Response!",
      });
  };
  ```
**Impact:** After voting, the UI won't update immediately. Users will see the old vote state until the page refreshes or the SWR cache revalidates. This creates a laggy, unresponsive feel.
**Remediation:** Import useSWRConfig and add mutate calls to update the vote cache optimistically.

## MessageEditor Missing Server Action Integration
**File:** features/chat/components/message-editor.tsx
