          const timer = setTimeout(() => {
              setIsOpen(false);
          }, 1000);
          return () => clearTimeout(timer);
      }
      return undefined;
  }, [hasBeenStreaming, isLoading, isOpen]);
  ```
**Impact:** Users who want to read the reasoning after it completes need to manually re-open it. This may frustrate users who prefer to review the reasoning process after the response is complete.
