**Old Code:** archive/oldapp/app/(chat)/chat-layout-client.tsx:54-57 - `<Script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/pyodide/v0.23.4/full/pyodide.js" strategy="lazyOnload" />`
**New Code:** app/(chat)/layout.tsx - No Pyodide script present
**Impact:** Python code artifacts will not execute. The code artifact component (if migrated) will fail to run Python code in the browser. This breaks a core feature for code artifacts.
**Remediation:** Add the Pyodide script tag to the chat layout, or ensure it's loaded dynamically in the code artifact component itself (the old app also has fallback loading in archive/oldapp/artifacts/code/client.tsx).

## Missing Notice Toast Handler
**File:** app/(chat)/layout.tsx
**Severity:** High
