## Missing "Go Home" Navigation in Error Boundary
**File:** app/error.tsx
**Severity:** High
**Issue:** The old app's chat error boundary provided TWO recovery options: "Go Home" button (navigates to "/") and "Try Again" button (calls reset()). The new app only has "Try Again" button, removing the ability to navigate away from the error page.
**Old Code:** archive/oldapp/app/(chat)/error.tsx:33-38
  ```tsx
  <div className="flex gap-3">
      <Button onClick={() => router.push("/")} variant="outline">
          Go Home
      </Button>
      <Button onClick={() => reset()}>Try Again</Button>
  </div>
  ```
**New Code:** app/error.tsx:60-63
