## Missing Dynamic Import for AppSidebar
**File:** app/(chat)/layout.tsx
**Severity:** Medium
**Issue:** The old app used dynamic import with ssr: false for AppSidebar to prevent server-side rendering issues. The new app imports it directly.
**Old Code:** archive/oldapp/app/(chat)/chat-layout-client.tsx:16-22 - `dynamic(() => import("@/components/app-sidebar")..., { ssr: false, loading: () => <SidebarSkeleton /> })`
**New Code:** app/(chat)/layout.tsx:17 - `import { AppSidebar } from "@/features/sidebar/components/sidebar"` (static import)
